# Build context for research-runner:m3-latest is research_lab/ (Dockerfile bakes
# strategies/). Only docker/ and strategies/ are needed in the image, so keep the
# context small: drop data, caches, the worker venv, probes, and bytecode.
data/
numba-cache/
worker/
probes/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*:Zone.Identifier
